  "description": "charlesw/tesseract's .NET wrapper for Tesseract OCR, built from a\n      patched fork (jbtule/tesseract#arm64-platform-detection) with several\n      native-library-loading fixes -- works cross-platform with zero setup\n      after a normal `dotnet publish -r <rid>`. Depends on\n      Tesseract.Native, so installing this one package restores the\n      matching native binaries for whichever of\n      win-x64/win-arm64/linux-x64/osx-arm64 you're building for.\n\n      API-compatible drop-in replacement for the stock Tesseract package --\n      same namespace and types. Install this INSTEAD OF Tesseract, not\n      alongside it.",
